  DisplayName: Serpent Gulag
  Description: 'Serpents only - a sniper duel at range. You spawn far apart in a huge cell with a field
    of elemental crystals floating in the middle. Charge reloads your rifle faster, so the
    field is where you load up, in everyone''s sights. Hold LT to scope and RT to fire - a
    round that strips a rival pilot is one snipe. Higher intensities add sniper nests and
    barred cell blocks. First team to the target wins.'
